/**
 * Campus Connect – single-file full‑stack starter
 * Tech: Node.js (Express) backend + TailwindCSS + LeafletJS frontend (served by Express)
 *
 * How to run:
 * 1) Save this file as `server.js`
 * 2) Run:   npm init -y && npm install express
 * 3) Start: node server.js
 * 4) Open:  http://localhost:3000
 *
 * What you get:
 * - "Colleges" section with details & search
 * - Listings for PG / Hostels / Flats / Rooms with price, rating, coordinates
 * - Interactive map with markers (college + listings)
 * - Auto distance calculation (in km) from selected college to each listing
 * - Add new listings via form (stored in-memory for demo)
 * - Clean, responsive UI with Tailwind
 *
 * Notes:
 * - This is a demo with in-memory data. Replace with a real DB later (Mongo/Postgres).
 * - All frontend assets are served from this single file.
 */

